    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Slack: claim button\nSlack's interactivity URL. Checks Slack's signature on the raw body (HMAC-SHA256 of `v0:timestamp:body`, 5-minute replay window) and answers **401** if it's wrong, **200** within Slack's 3 seconds if it's right.\n\n- Claim: Slack user's email → HubSpot owner → `hubspot_owner_id` on the deal → message shows \"Claimed by\".\n- The signing secret lives in the encrypted Crypto credential **Slack Signing Secret**, never in the workflow.\n- Plan: `docs/HUBSPOT_PLAN.md`, build 2.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 600
      },
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
